{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33a12cb0db3130a45874718fd986ef08694d1ea3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16x^4 - y^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> factored into its real prime factors is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39de274c925d7d067e3f3599351e851c47fc6b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad (4x^2+y^2)(2x-y)^2 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad (4x^2+y^2)(4x^2-y)^2 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad (4x^2+y^2)(2x-y)(2x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"681\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/2/142e99c1d9adec1fd8fac0f12666790d78cb5c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad 16(x^2+y^2)(x-y)(x+y) \\quad \\text{(E) can&#39;t be factored}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"413\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use difference of squares.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c20c7b17a988a76a0fd0e58aecd1234895f6fd1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16x^4 - y^4 = (4x^2+y^2)(4x^2-y^2) = (4x^2+y^2)(2x+y)(2x-y)\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"19\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee90f076869827dbb3b46ebe83c1a7399f1182dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_13\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 13\"> Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_15\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced ex